# Capture-reply pool (رد الأكل).
#
# Upload the captured piece's owner answering back at the captor here, as
# .mp3/.ogg/.wav/.m4a/.aac/.webm files. Every file in this folder belongs to
# the `الأكل` reply pool only (no clip is shared between events). Selection is
# uniform random with no-immediate-repeat, exactly like ردود/إخراج_بيدق.
#
# Until clips exist, the capture reply is a safe no-op (empty pool).
